	(text "v1.0\n- Allows control for 2 contactors, one to control precharge & one for power enable\n- LED's show whether contactors are closed & if power is enabled (3 LED's)\nv2.0\n- Controls only 1 precharge contactor\n- Input will just tell whether both sides are connected to power\n- Add comparator circuitry to determine whether precharge is complete\nv2.1\n- Changed Precharge Contactor Connector to be Molex Microfit since 3A max \ncurrent load at <.5s\nv2.1-Daybreak\n- Removed precharge resistor\n- Contactor is now driven exclusively by Controls\n- Added Fan breakout power\n- Removed isolation\n- Added 2 more contactor drivers (there are now 3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.755 50.165 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
